
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>MANN HOSTING PANEL</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1120;
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }
    header {
      padding: 22px;
      background: #111827;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #273449;
    }
    header h2 { margin: 0; color: #60a5fa; }
    main { max-width: 850px; margin: auto; padding: 22px; }
    .welcome { color: #9ca3af; }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(145px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .card {
      background: #172033;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #29364c;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .number { font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold; }
    .muted { color: #9ca3af; font-size: 14px; }
    button {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: #2563eb;
      color: white;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .notice {
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #202b40;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    footer { color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 30px; font-size: 13px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h2>MANN HOSTING</h2>
    <div class="muted">Dashboard Panel</div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h1>Dashboard</h1>
    <p class="welcome">Selamat datang di panel hosting kamu!</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="muted">Website</div>
        <p class="number">1</p>
        <div class="muted">Demo dashboard</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="muted">Bot</div>
        <p class="number">0</p>
        <div class="muted">Belum terhubung</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="muted">Server</div>
        <p class="number">Demo</p>
        <div class="muted">Belum terhubung</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="card">
      <h3>Kelola Hosting</h3>
      <p class="muted">
        Ini dashboard tampilan. Belum terhubung ke server sungguhan.
      </p>
      <button onclick="info()">Informasi Panel</button>
      <p id="hasil"></p>
    </section>

    <br>

    <div class="notice">
      <strong>Catatan:</strong><br>
      Untuk menjalankan bot WhatsApp atau Node.js,
      hubungkan panel ini ke backend dan server hosting
      yang kamu miliki.
    </div>

    <footer>© 2026 MANN HOSTING · Dashboard Demo</footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    function info() {
      document.getElementById("hasil").textContent =
        "Panel berhasil dibuka. Server belum terhubung.";
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
